ark:text-gray-400\">Fund a student&#x27;s Islamic education journey</p><span class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light\">Donate now <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"group flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#21262d] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/8 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all\" href=\"/donate/zakat\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#b8860b] to-[#d4a017] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gift w-6 h-6 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M20 11v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 7a1 1 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 7a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 1 1 0 0 1 0 5\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"7\" width=\"18\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Zakat &amp; Waqf</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Fulfil your Zakat obligation through ALIF</p><span class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light\">Donate now <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\